# POM & API Patterns

## Pages
- Extend `BasePage`.
- Declare locators in the constructor; expose intent-based methods (`login`, `addProductByName`).
- Do not assert business outcomes inside pages except light `expectLoaded` helpers.

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — selector in test
await page.locator('#user-name').fill('x');

// ✅ GOOD — page method
await loginPage.login(user.username, user.password);
```

## API clients
- Extend `BaseApi`.
- One client per resource (`UsersApi`).
- Specs call client methods, then assert status/body — no raw `request.get` in specs.
